    <title id="hero-scene-title">Makers at work across a Kochi shore</title>
    <desc id="hero-scene-desc">A maker faire in progress, left to right: a weaving loom with a shuttle crossing it under the first canopy; a stand demonstrating a 3D printer; a shelf of finished pots on the next stand; a tall tower of meshing gears with someone up a ladder beside it; an easel holding a painting in progress; a six-axis robot arm; a wind turbine at the right edge; and one drone overhead. Thirteen makers and visitors are gathered at the stands, one with their back to us and one using a wheelchair.</desc>

